{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 316384, "items": [{"issue": "5", "abstract": "<jats:p>随着癌症发病率的升高,导致全球每年死于癌症人数迅速增长。长 链 非 编 码   RNA(long noncoding  RNA, lncRNA) 因其在生物学过程中影响肿瘤细胞的增殖、迁移、侵袭、凋亡、耐药、血管形成等而成为癌症 研 究 的 热 门 领 域。如 其 在 DNA 甲基化、基因印迹、组蛋白修饰以及染色质重构等方面具有重要调控作用,本文就lncRNA 与部分消化系统肿瘤的研究进展予 以综述。</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.36012/pmr.v2i5.2746", "type": "journal-article", "page": "20-22", "title": ["长链非编码 ＲＮＡ 在消化系统肿瘤中的研究进展"], "volume": "2", "author": [{"given": "晓娟", "family": "郑", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "丽敏", "family": "鄢", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "猛", "family": "赵", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "梦思", "family": "张", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "志勇", "family": "张", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "container-title": ["实用医学研究"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2020, 10, 31]]}}, {"issue": "09", "DOI": "10.12677/acm.2023.1392110", "type": "journal-article", "page": "15092-15098", "title": ["Research Progress of Long Non-Coding RNA CASC19 in Tumors"], "volume": "13", "author": [{"given": "凤凤", "family": "安", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "container-title": ["Advances in Clinical Medicine"], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2023]]}}, {"issue": "05", "DOI": "10.12677/acm.2018.85075", "type": "journal-article", "page": "454-459", "title": ["Research Advancements of Long Non-Coding RNA MEG3 in Tumor"], "volume": "08", "author": [{"given": "晶", "family": "周", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref